      <title>Polaska 0.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 07:24:11 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>0.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
The first public build.

- A glass tab strip pinned under every visible browser window, on any of the four edges.
- Works with Chromium browsers (Vivaldi, Chrome, Edge, Brave, Arc, Opera) and with Zen and Firefox, through one extension.
- Standard and spacious tab layouts.
- Playback controls on tabs that play media.
- English, Russian and Greek.

Requires macOS 26 on Apple Silicon and the Polaska browser extension.
]]></description>
